                    the CIA sent the Department of State exclusive
                    for Rusk, Ball, Harriman, and
                        Hilsman. Copies were also sent to the
                    White House exclusive for Bundy and to the Assistant Chief of Staff for
                    Intelligence, Department of the Army, exclusive for McNamara, Gilpatric,
                        Taylor, and Krulak.</p>
